00:45:42.860 --> 00:45:44.849
I love everything about that letter.
我喜欢这封信的一切。

00:45:44.849 --> 00:45:45.788
Thank you, Julia.
谢谢你，茱莉亚。

00:45:45.788 --> 00:45:46.728
That's fantastic.
太棒了。

00:45:46.728 --> 00:45:51.756
And I'm so glad we can keep you company on your drive as you part ways from your boyfriend.
我很高兴在我们与男友分开的路上，能用这个节目陪伴你。

00:45:51.756 --> 00:45:54.740
But I'm glad you guys have the show to share together.
但我很高兴你们俩有这部剧可以一起分享。

00:45:54.740 --> 00:45:58.497
I love when I think it's a great show for couples to watch together.
我喜欢——我认为这是一部非常适合情侣一起看的剧。

00:45:58.497 --> 00:45:58.997
I agree.
我同意。

00:45:58.940 --> 00:46:10.807
And I also, I love that there's kind of like, there are these, how I met your mother years, 27 to 36, where it's funny when people are in their 20s and they say, I'm 24.
而且我也——我喜欢那种存在着的，类似《老爸老妈浪漫史》年龄段的说法，也就是27岁到36岁，有意思的是当人们二十多岁时会说，我都24岁了。

00:46:10.807 --> 00:46:11.579
I'm so old.
我都这么老了。

00:46:11.579 --> 00:46:14.771
You know, and you're like, you're like, yeah, your life hasn't started yet.
你知道的，然后你会想，你会觉得，没错，你的人生还没开始呢。

00:46:14.771 --> 00:46:15.579
You're not even 27.
你甚至还没到27岁。

00:46:17.449 --> 00:46:24.391
So anyway, thanks for that letter, and thanks for all the letters and delighted to spend some time with you all, and we'll see you next time.
总之，谢谢这封信，也谢谢所有的来信，很高兴能和大家度过一段时光，我们下期再见。

00:46:24.391 --> 00:46:25.130
Thanks so much.
非常感谢。

